## 5.1 Memory Types

Implement:

### Working Memory
Temporary information needed during the current task.

### Episodic Memory
Events, conversations, actions, outcomes, successes, failures, and experiences.

### Semantic Memory
Facts, concepts, knowledge, relationships, and verified information.

### Procedural Memory
Skills, instructions, workflows, policies, and learned execution procedures.

### Personal Memory
Stable user preferences, identity context, recurring goals, and relevant user-specific information with consent and privacy controls.

### Organizational Memory
Workspace-specific information, policies, documents, business facts, operational context, and organizational knowledge.

### Temporal Memory
Facts and events with valid time, recording when information became true and when it stopped being true.

